ra Pradesh and adjoining south Odisha. The system is likely to maintain its intensity as a Deep Depression initially and move northwestwards. Thereafter, it is likely to move north-northwestwards and gradually weaken during the next 24 hours.\n"},"parts":[{"label":{"ne":"आज राति","en":"Tonight"},"text":{"ne":"देशभर अधिकांश बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा तथा कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी, बागमती,  गण्डकी र  लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागको अधिकांश स्थानमा तथा सुदूरपश्चिम  प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्म वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी  प्रदेशको थोरै स्थानमा साथै मधेश प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी देखि धेरै भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्विनी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा हावाहुरीको समेत सम्भावना छ ।\n","en":" Mostly cloudy conditions will prevail throughout the country. Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, and at some places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at most places in Madhesh Province and the Terai areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, and at some places in the Terai areas of Sudurpashchim Province. Heavy to very heavy rainfall is likely at a few places in Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, and at one or two places in Madhesh Province. Windstorms are also likely at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces.      "}},{"label":{"ne":"भोलि","en":"Tomorrow"},"text":{"ne":"देशभर अधिकांश बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी  र कर्णाली प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा  तथा सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका पहाडी र तराई भू-भाग, कर्णाली प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा  साथै मधेश प्रदेशका केही स्थानमा तथा सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको पहाडी र तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र कर्णाली प्रदेशको थोरै स्थानमा भारी देखि धेरै भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | लुम्बिनी र गण्डकी प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा अति भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । मधेश प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा हावाहुरीको समेत सम्भावना छ ।\n","en":" Mostly cloudy conditions will prevail throughout the country. Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the Himalayan areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini and Karnali Provinces, and at some places in the Himalayan areas of Sudurpashchim Province. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the hilly and Terai areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces and the hilly areas of Karnali Province, at some places in Madhesh Province, and at some places in the hilly and Terai areas of Sudurpashchim Province. Heavy to very heavy rainfall is likely at a few places in Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini and Karnali Provinces. Extremely heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in Lumbini and Gandaki Provinces. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in Madhesh Province. Windstorms are also likely at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces.      "}}]}],"model_issued":[{"at":"2026-09-25T06:53:08+05:45","points":[{"id":"dhunche","daily":[{"date":"2026-09-25","tmax":16.7,"tmin":14.9,"rain_mm":59.4,"pop":100.0,"wmo":80,"wind_kmh":5.8,"gust_kmh":42.8,"icon":"rain","dhm_level":"red"},{"date":"2026-09-26","tmax":21.3,"tmin":15